{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All sides of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Convex_polygon\" title=\"Convex polygon\">convex</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pentagon\" title=\"Pentagon\">pentagon</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f13a96240c51d61ba3733d9f5c3020fa92ec4136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCDE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> are of equal length, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/5/c55d22ef9032402d68b10b00b4eacd933803515d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A = \\angle B = 90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"126\" height=\"13\" />. What is the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef820980d93fb66d6f4b2883b9630d6bbdfd2667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle E$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a48fe47c0f91c727abfd5a7daade4b9179bb6f91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm {(A)}\\ 90 \\qquad \\mathrm {(B)}\\ 108 \\qquad \\mathrm {(C)}\\ 120 \\qquad \\mathrm {(D)}\\ 144 \\qquad \\mathrm {(E)}\\ 150$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"426\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007_12B_AMC-7.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d5/2007_12B_AMC-7.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"197\" height=\"332\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_angle\" title=\"Right angle\">right angles</a>, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897c5861ff0e7e01fa2ad067a42326369f5ae338.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AECB$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> is a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Square\" title=\"Square\">square</a>. Since the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc2afec04e3636c80fa3d89e5468045595151c4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ED$\" width=\"29\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> are also 5, triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/b/c7bc69328ef74607767b467b2a851f202438edec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDE$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Equilateral_triangle\" title=\"Equilateral triangle\">equilateral</a>. Angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/7/90735d0a5827bbec0e4e82b406e2c5f6a5fa0150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90+60=150 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=